{
  "title": "Ziyarate Hazrat Abbas (a.s.)",
  "data": "اَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اَبَی الْفَضْلِ الْعَبَّاسَ ابْنَ اَمِیْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya aba alfadli al`abbasa bna amiri almu'minina\nPeace be upon you, O Abu al-Fadl al-`Abbas, son of the Commander of the Faithful,\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ سَیِّدِ الْوَصِیِّیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka yabna sayyidi alwasiyyina\npeace be upon you, O son of the master of the successors,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ اَوَّلَ الْقَوْمِ اِسْلاَمًا\nalssalamu `alayka yabna awwali alqawmi islaman\npeace be upon you, O son of the first of the people to accept Islam,\nوَاَقْدَمِهِمْ اِیْمَاناً\nwa aqdamihim imanan\nand the earliest of them in faith,\nوَاَقْوَمِهِمْ بِدِیْنِ اللّٰهِ\nwa aqwamihim bidini allahi\nand the most steadfast of them in Allah’s religion,\nوَاَحْوَطِهِمْ عَلَی الْاِسْلاَمِ\nwa ahwatihim `ala al-islami\nand the most protective of them of Islam.\nاَشْهَدُ لَقَدْ نَصَحْتَ لِلّٰهِ وَلِرَسُوْلِهٖ وَلِاَخِیْكَ\nashhadu laqad nasahta lillahi wa lirasulihi wa li'akhika\nI bear witness that you sincerely served Allah, His Messenger, and your brother –\nفَنِعْمَ الْاَخُ الْمَوَاسِیْ\nfani`ma al-akhu almuwasi\nwhat an excellent, self-sacrificing brother!\nفَلَعَنَ اللّٰهُ اُمَّۃً اِسْتَحَلَّتْ مِنْكَ الْمَحَارِمَ\nfala`ana allahu ummatan istahallat minka almaharima\nMay Allah curse the nation that made lawful against you what is forbidden,\nوَانْتَهَكَتْ حُرْمَۃَ الْاِسْلاَمِ\nwantahakat hurmata al-islami\nand violated the sanctity of Islam.\nفَنِعْمَ الصَّابِرُ الْمُجَاهِدُ الْمُحَامِیْ النَّاصِرُ\nfani`ma alssabiru almujahidu almuhami alnnasiru\nWhat an excellent patient one, striver, defender, and helper you were!\nوَالْاَخُ الدَّافِعُ عَنْ اَخِیْهِ الْمُجَیْبُ\nwal-akhu alddafi`u `an akhihi\nand the brother who defended his brother,\nاِلیٰ طَاعَۃِ رَبِّهِ الرَّاغِبُ\nalmujibu ila ta`ati rabbihi\nthe one who responded in obedience to his Lord,\nفِی مَا زَهِدَفِیْهِ غَیْرُهٗ مِنَ الثَّوَابَ الْجَزِیْلِ وَالثَّنَائِ الْجَمِیْلِ\nalrraghibu fima zahida fihi ghayruhu mina alththawabi aljazili walththana'i aljamili\ndesirous of what others turned away from – abundant reward and beautiful praise.\nوَاَلْحَقَكَ اللّٰهُ بَدَرَجَۃِ اٰبَائِكَ فِیْ جَنَّاتٍ النَّعِیْمِ۔\nwa alhaqaka allahu bidarajati aba'ika fi jannati alna`imi\nand may Allah join you to the rank of your forefathers in the Gardens of Bliss."
}
